                    <h2 id="rental-cards-PATCHapi-dashboard-rental-cards--id-">Update a rental card&#039;s mutable fields.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Only <code>end_date</code>, <code>terms</code>, <code>notes</code>, and <code>is_renewable</code> are mutable.
<code>property_id</code>, <code>owner_id</code>, <code>tenant_user_id</code>, and <code>start_date</code> are
immutable after creation; submit a new card instead.</p>

<span id="example-requests-PATCHapi-dashboard-rental-cards--id-">
